WEBVTT

NOTE Machine translated from English captions; target=ny.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.718
Kanemayu akuwonetsa momwe mungawunikire ma neurovision ndikutulutsa magalasi.

2
00:00:04.718 --> 00:00:08.020
Sambani m'manja ndipo musakome.

3
00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:12.737
Mufunika tchati cha neurovision, cholembera ndi zolemba zamankhwala, mitundu

4
00:00:12.737 --> 00:00:17.455
wa magalasi owerengera ndi chingwe chachitali cha 40cm.

5
00:00:17.455 --> 00:00:21.700
Fotokozani zomwe muchita kuti mupeze chilolezo.

6
00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:25.475
Mukhazikitseni wodwala bwinobwino pamalo owala bwino.

7
00:00:25.475 --> 00:00:32.551
Gwiritsani ntchito chingwe kuti muwonetsetse kuti tchaticho chili pamtunda wolondola wa 40cm.

8
00:00:32.551 --> 00:00:37.740
Afunseni kuti awerenge tchati ndi maso onse pamodzi.

9
00:00:37.740 --> 00:00:42.500
Lembani mzere wawung'ono kwambiri womwe angawerenge momasuka.

10
00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:49.220
Ngati sangathe kuwerenga mzere wa N8, yesani ndi magalasi ozungulira a 1.5 diopter.

11
00:00:49.220 --> 00:00:53.376
Ngati angawerengebe N8, ndiye gwiritsani ntchito mphamvu yapamwamba, ndi zina zotero

12
00:00:53.376 --> 00:00:54.860
pitirira, mpaka iwo angakhoze bwino

13
00:00:54.860 --> 00:00:57.540
werengani mawu a N8.

14
00:00:57.540 --> 00:01:00.660
Onetsetsani kuti galasi ndi fiddle-k ndipo wodwalayo ali wokondwa ndi maonekedwe awo.
